Ramflux is a product brand of Span Brain.

This repository contains the AGPL-3.0-or-later Android client for Ramflux. It
depends on the BSD-3-Clause Ramflux core workspace maintained in the
ramfluxhq/ramflux repository.

The native build statically links OpenSSL 3.6.3 for the SDK's SQLCipher backend.
OpenSSL is licensed under Apache-2.0; its license is included in the SDK AAR.
The reused Keystore helper retains its BSD-3-Clause SPDX header.
